                                        "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                        "entry_id": "0c9fe138-1706-3420-ae8e-5112eaa29577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Experienced, especially in terms of a profession or a hobby"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8528034-5083-4378-8468-80b8cbfa676e",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                                "text": "a seasoned traveller"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cae600ff-ac79-4107-b43b-6bd374fdc3de",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                                "text": "a seasoned player"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f7c77db-69c9-4871-9e9b-c7c8122d4d02",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                                "text": "a seasoned actor"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e15f157-00ce-4bc1-8254-930639892514",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                                "text": "With only two fit centre-backs available, Tottenham boss Harry Redknapp employed young midfielder Jake Livermore at the back alongside Sebastien Bassong but Spurs struggled against a seasoned Champions League outfit, who beat Barcelona at the Nou Camp in 2009-10 and continually worked their way between the home defence to create some golden opportunities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edd90cb0-83c0-4e05-a594-66ac32bc67fb",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                                "text": "While you do these exercises, typing each one in, you will make mistakes. It’s inevitable; even seasoned programmers make a few."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a279a763-4222-44be-8da3-4d0b4fa85e51",
                                                "sense_id": "7e4f1cc5-c5ad-3d2d-88d9-add0e859394e",
                                                "text": "\"Commuters know where they're going, they grab a coffee, know which platform, which part of the train - they're pretty seasoned."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2892fcdf-85a8-3476-9504-43b07521978e",
                                        "entry_id": "0c9fe138-1706-3420-ae8e-5112eaa29577",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a food, often a liquid: containing seasonings"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cb38b12-e2e9-483d-9982-738ce099b979",
                                                "sense_id": "2892fcdf-85a8-3476-9504-43b07521978e",
                                                "text": "Pan-simmer baked seitan cutlets in Basic Broth (page 20) or other seasoned stock for 15 minutes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55731175-bc23-4cdb-8145-ba8b2f7fe672",
                                                "sense_id": "2892fcdf-85a8-3476-9504-43b07521978e",
                                                "text": "Delicious, fresh bread — especially a killer herb-seasoned loaf — and a stellar creamy dill dressing elevate Brother Juniper's sandwiches beyond the routine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "490615be-057b-4ffc-b3c8-7d88765a00b9",
                                                "sense_id": "2892fcdf-85a8-3476-9504-43b07521978e",
                                                "text": "A good definition for broth would be “seasoned stock.” With the possible addition of salt and other seasonings, fats, or thickening agents, broth is tasty and satisfying."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3959585a-1594-4d99-8887-8c6a198f1497",
                                                "sense_id": "2892fcdf-85a8-3476-9504-43b07521978e",
                                                "text": "Since these noodles are dried, they are often served with a side of seasoned stock."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
